msgid "In ancient Athens, ostracism was the process by which any citizen, including political leaders, could be expelled from the city-state for 10 years."
msgstr "Na antiga Atenas, o ostracismo era o proceso polo cal calquera cidadán, incluídos os líderes políticos, podía ser expulsado da cidade-estado durante 10 anos."

msgid "In ancient Sparta, the Helots who were freed by the state in reward for military service were known as Neodamodes."
msgstr "Na antiga Esparta, os ilotas que foron liberados polo estado como recompensa polo servizo militar eran coñecidos como Neodamodes."

